Misc: {
	FourSymbolsRite: {
		Begin: The Four Symbols Tablet resounds — the Rite of the Four Symbols begins!
		RiseEast: The eastern mansions kindle — the Azure Dragon soars above the clouds!
		RiseSouth: The southern mansions ignite — the Vermilion Bird bathes in heavenly fire!
		RiseWest: The western mansions gleam — the White Tiger's roar splits the sky!
		RiseNorth: The northern mansions deepen — the Black Tortoise rises from the abyss!
		FallEast: The East is stilled; the Azure Dragon ascends as rain.
		FallSouth: The South is stilled; the phoenix fire gutters into falling stars.
		FallWest: The West is stilled; the tiger's roar breaks upon the golden wind.
		Complete: The Black Tortoise returns to the depths — the Four Symbols are home, and heaven finds its balance.
		Broken: A sacred beast has left the field; the rite is broken.
	}
}

